# The source integrals `∫ h₊ S_k`, `k = 1, …, 70`, at `L = 11/8`

Fourteen `decide +kernel` batches of `CvSTauL118V1.tauCheck` (data from `tools/gen_tau118.py`,
untrusted) give `source_integral_mem`: a box of width at most `2·10⁻⁸` for every `k = 1, …, 70`.
These are the digamma parts of `τ_k` for the low block of the `L = 11/8` window. Not RH.
-/

